                            "storage",
                            "s3",
                            "config"
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "Return the externally-reachable endpoint URL and the SigV4 signing\nregion for the S3 protocol gateway. The endpoint is assembled from\nthe server's `VITE_API_BASE_URL` env var plus `/storage/v1/s3`, and\nthe region is `AWS_REGION` (default `us-east-2`).\n\nIntended for Dashboard display so the UI doesn't make any\nbackend-topology assumptions client-side."
